[scene name="OceanRibbonLookdev" version=1]
; A continuous, bounded river with flow and material optics,
; running in a channel its own spline carves through the terrain and out into the sea.
; The ocean surface detail guide (docs/Rendering/ocean-surface-detail.html) explains the controls.

